OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood games that died and
OL,4,Athose that survive
OL,5,
OL,6,FHave you heard of tin block, booler or
OL,7,Fstoolball? A new exhibition recalls the
OL,8,Fchildren's street games that have
OL,9,Fdisappeared, along with others that
OL,10,Fhave endured down generations.
OL,12,FPlaygrounds to Pixels: A Journey
OL,13,FThrough Play, gathers historical
OL,14,Fphotographs and literature, as well as
OL,15,Fthe memories of people who grew up in
OL,16,FBeverley in the 1950s and 60s, to
OL,17,Fexplore how childhood play has evolved
OL,18,Fin the town and around the world.
OL,20,FIt will open at Beverley Guildhall on 7
OL,21,FOctober and runs until February 2027.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
